### Our Model

We must now choose a functional form for the companion mass distribution, p(M_{2}\\,|\\,\\boldsymbol{\\theta}). We use a two-component Gaussian mixture model. We truncate the distributions using physically motivated bounds: the WD component is restricted to M_{2}\\in[0.2,1.44] M{}_{\\odot} and

